<title>UK: Partco interim pre-tax profits rise 20 pct.</title>
<headline>Partco interim pre-tax profits rise 20 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		10.8		   vs 9.5</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 2.50		   vs 2.25</p>
<p> Pretax		     4.4		    vs 3.6</p>
<p> Turnover		   88.0		   vs 82.3</p>
<p> Operating result	 5.0		    vs 4.4</p>
<p> Interest		   0.6		    vs 0.8</p>
<p> Tax			  1.2		    vs 0.8</p>
<p> Net taxed		  3.2		    vs 2.8</p>
<p> Pay date		   November 11 1996</p>
<p>Div registration date  November 5 1996</p>
<p>NOTE -- Partco is an automotive parts distributor.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom, +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
